--outFile \\<path\\> <sup>`*`</sup>   | outFile <sup>`*`</sup>   | string   | Bundle output location.                                                          |                                            |         |\n| --rootDir \\<path\\>                      | rootDir                  | string   | Specifies the root directory of input files.                                     |                                            |         |\n| -w, --watch [boolean]                   | watch                    | boolean  | Watch files for changes. Works with `rootDir`.                                   |                                            |         |\n| --ignoreImports \\<list\\>                | ignoreImports            | string[] | Ignore resolving import content by matching a regular expression.                |                                            |         |\n| --includePaths \\<list\\>                 | includePaths             | string[] | Include paths for resolving imports.                                             |                                            |         |\n| --dedupeGlobs \\<list\\>                  | dedupeGlobs              | string[] | Files that will be emitted in a bundle once.                                     |                                            |         |\n| --logLevel \\<level\\>                    | logLevel                 | string   | Console log level.                                                               | silent, error, warning, info, debug, trace | info    |\n\n`*` - Required\n\n### Example config\n\nDefault name for configuration is `scss-bundle.config.json`.\n\n```json\n{\n    \"bundlerOptions\": {\n        \"entryFile\": \"./tests/cases/simple/main.scss\",\n        \"rootDir\": \"./tests/cases/simple/\",\n        \"outFile\": \"./bundled.scss\",\n        \"ignoreImports\": [\"~@angular/.*\"],\n        \"logLevel\": \"silent\"\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Non-CLI usage\n\n### Simple example\n\n```typescript\nimport path from \"path\";\nimport { Bundler } from \"scss-bundle\";\n\n(async () => {\n    // Absolute project directory path.\n    const projectDirectory = path.resolve(__dirname, \"./cases/tilde-import\");\n    const bundler = new Bundler(undefined, projectDirectory);\n    // Relative file path to project directory path.\n    const result = await bundler.bundle(\"./main.scss\");\n})();\n```\n\n# API\n\n## Bundler\n\n```typescript\nimport { Bundler } from \"scss-bundle\";\n```\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nconstructor(fileRegistry: FileRegistry = {}, projectDirectory?: string) {}\n```\n\n##### Arguments\n\n-   `fileRegistry?:` [Registry](#registry) - Dictionary of files contents by full path\n-   `projectDirectory?: string` - Absolute project location, where `node_modules` are located. Used for resolving tilde imports\n\n### Methods\n\n#### bundle\n\n```typescript\npublic async bundle(file: string, fileRegistry: Registry = {}): Promise<BundleResult>\n```\n\n##### Arguments\n\n-   `file: string` - Main file full path\n-   `fileRegistry:` [Registry](#registry) - Dictionary of files contents by full path\n\n##### Returns\n\n`Promise<`[BundleResult](#bundleresult)`>`\n\n### Contracts\n\n#### BundleResult\n\n```typescript\nimport { BundleResult } from \"scss-bundle\";\n```\n\n```typescript\ninterface BundleResult {\n    imports?: BundleResult[];\n    tilde?: boolean;\n    filePath: string;\n    content?: string;\n    found: boolean;\n}\n```\n\n##### Properties\n\n-   `imports:` [BundleResult](#bundleresult)`[]` - File imports array\n-   `tilde?: boolean` - Used tilde import\n-   `filePath: string` - Full file path\n-   `content: string` - File content\n-   `found: boolean` - Is file found\n\n#### Registry\n\n```typescript\nimport { Registry } from \"scss-bundle\";\n```\n\n```typescript\ninterface Registry {\n    [id: string]: string | undefined;\n}\n```\n\n##### Key\n\n`id: string` - File full path as dictionary id\n\n##### Value\n\n`string | undefined` - File content\n\n## License\n\nReleased under the [MIT license](LICENSE).\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","_id":"scss-bundle@0.0.0-canary.cae5b9e","_nodeVersion":"10.16.3","_npmVersion":"6.11.3","_npmUser":{"name":"reactway-dev","email":"dev@reactway.com"},"maintainers":[{"email":"dovydas@quatrodev.com","name":"quatrodev"},{"email":"dev@reactway.com","name":"reactway-dev"}],"dist":{"integrity":"sha512-C0tR8w2UVOheM7fuzAiNPeSfNANpsdE7yEG0XRH1GuGie7IotreeBVJVyFIpt7Q8BfJfa+UYb1x9m3qG1E8Jxg==","shasum":"31e02f7394b1d3a064e378dcc0bf456db5398d9e","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/scss-bundle/-/scss-bundle-0.0.0-canary.cae5b9e.tgz","fileCount":45,"unpackedSize":55276,"npm-signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\nVersion: OpenPGP.js v3.0.4\r\nComment: https://openpgpjs.org\r\n\r\nwsFcBAEBCAAQBQJdtf1zCRA9TVsSAnZWagAALK8P/1bRT0lCxBCCoJ1Vl7Q0\n8ztXNjRAiSxf7FiW7JBdQrFXAWdc+Fw8GZ/+vCHdeSdRP9UBRLNkSjSYVd8J\nFFEEhc1eFP69qLHpLBDXTrbmYX3+GcgzpssbE3eKnO7/W23PlvMABb8BAXbW\nqpuQV2llij4dOcK3TOsZQv9ttZ9OXOCGBpSOQYmCMtIg3sSTnW7hZlvaNqrv\nnLranVpZzB/Jb9J3QkUCF+XAMkma/hlZk9pQ8zw1ygWo1/r8HInHfy7zv102\njrORoD2Rx3v6ydAPhBK/u+kQarogcJ2a8gaLtmruL8CkLv1Io3QB+nTIdBgg\nTdHjfCiTsksGjX6DDoPJEN8bf5OAmZADWII1otrxh+Mg5oOVC6qQCNT/ZnLi\nxnXutq4f/tyukHXFeLjLh1tuy8pR0DnXFz91BQQ6aDQTpsTXl9i3Jlj2k37I\nDQuP53qXWjfTd5xgB5OHrgwdqjuA3UpI9HZsQSm70SCSSCtYp7DF46MF2srR\n5E7lO82HIwkTBf+N/NMpn1nERs2u2k+HULPOgrXuTxSnKAPoFNpET14RyCZh\nflPS71ISXU7OkG7CS9jAlhRWEXSwfwePAH6Af5bV7E+bgksox2XfS74lz1Cu\nCSY5JECM/lg9JXKecKK9PzcLUcrM9pDXsOPlHOpr5CYF4eKJEYni+Qau3VqF\n/Tqf\r\n=Sz+o\r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\n","signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bwswu80PjjokCgh0o2w5c2U4LhQAE57gj9cz1kzA","sig":"MEQCIE9+QNK4t84SjXwREqYcvUc2MN0vQJ4WoRLYv3o4t+XcAiBb/g8Uxle1yXzlxmv6kAGryApgW7pqfpsouDRhvM2bXA=="}]},"directories":{},"_npmOperationalInternal":{"host":"s3://npm-registry-packages","tmp":"tmp/scss-bundle_0.0.0-canary.cae5b9e_1572207986714_0.711582829864323"},"_hasShrinkwrap":false},"3.0.2":{"name":"scss-bundle","version":"3.0.2","descriptio