ePath: string` - Full file path\n-   `content: string` - File content\n-   `found: boolean` - Is file found\n\n#### Registry\n\n```typescript\nimport { Registry } from \"scss-bundle\";\n```\n\n```typescript\ninterface Registry {\n    [id: string]: string | undefined;\n}\n```\n\n##### Key\n\n`id: string` - File full path as dictionary id\n\n##### Value\n\n`string | undefined` - File content\n\n## License\n\nReleased under the [MIT license](LICENSE).\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","_id":"scss-bundle@0.0.0-canary.9f111cb","_nodeVersion":"12.13.1","_npmVersion":"6.13.2","_npmUser":{"name":"reactway-dev","email":"dev@reactway.com"},"maintainers":[{"email":"dovydas@quatrodev.com","name":"quatrodev"},{"email":"dev@reactway.com","name":"reactway-dev"}],"dist":{"integrity":"sha512-AmSU5Xef/O9XR8kbc+L7AwdcGMqfBexNjVKg7SL2FlybrppBo1A33BfBzoIDX4K/p866NyhSLv9x+pNGAuU+Sg==","shasum":"7d5c2e64d4e570b3665463be29530f23765e7291","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/scss-bundle/-/scss-bundle-0.0.0-canary.9f111cb.tgz","fileCount":45,"unpackedSize":57450,"npm-signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\nVersion: OpenPGP.js v3.0.4\r\nComment: https://openpgpjs.org\r\n\r\nwsFcBAEBCAAQBQJd+iA7CRA9TVsSAnZWagAAsN4P/ReQZPnuHxCSjnu7O2NT\nORSN7oaTHLUtD35g9d8OoAA3BQbZKARu1YCCSnYwS4BxwVSJzHJbSedKMm7f\nG1/AwhmzhnpkF4LVdjLLsPvwPcroqDtF3DgWl8jAzgqXD+l4c6T63I1YyBnF\nF0a4s7IbnPtpYmHMsrb0H8BPhdc/My018uSjzcmFS8LOLr1Q2+NLeYf7+fbw\nM8Q5LIitRCm7INvBRoKwxAMojdUX3PXzBXaUJ+TvvFb+Oer3LHKoeTPIgTJb\nWsH+0TlhEWyjN9CsAg2+QBT/hEODxIe2tCkUU8bwmPf3TAADGwQU1wU2IFAc\n50aPj7qc7JYTG10FZ4rMyp4Ou4RTVRa9JYdghZYset4Me95+OXHymZ9sPToE\nNfRN+aQ3ZB+wceILrVHxkzOcOd8pjFQTOlvuqJ9K4A4UZcw6O1lzSUZapusm\nKwgPRrdnVMKZit7NkAFeflgJSwcVOH/S9KAhXZ3aJilxdA93+F3czHUpXW4k\nMsbhxRzR6LuTIaR50h7M8QAz7OnEpU1IHM7UI+1pABcypFweD34gbJT8DBrS\n1e2nxvMOcjRtCUDCARkWg3+Q1IG0P5oS0Nn0hMI8GBMtkZxzH8a9TPaOnWvj\nu44Y9tAMbYs0rwUU8cWCsvFz4cSefXUHQI+prMkvK8Qg3A69kzj/6Zjd4nqU\nwPNj\r\n=GHXP\r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\n","signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bw